Rationale: Native 5.3 Gaussian primary/shadow intersections need the same existence intervals as point geometry before stochastic opacity; this extends 0005 to a new traversal path.
Contract: Apply the existing per-point shutter lifetime contract to native Gaussian splat primary and shadow intersections before stochastic opacity evaluation; keep the native 5.3 traversal and independent geometry-union packing unchanged.
Tests: tests/core_point_lifetime_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

